--- !u!114 &622874193
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 622874191}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 70c7cc5d303454b34ad9b8be327728bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Subnet.Hacking.HackableObstacle
  encounterTitle: COMMUTER_0451.exe  //  'THE WALL OF OVERTIME'
  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 50a023390a3de4aea83c75a001b5ebd7, type: 2}
  introLines:
  - Can't talk. Behind. Always behind.
  - If I stop moving, the paperwork catches up. So I became the paperwork.
  - '* My handheld vibrates. It wants to connect to him. To read whatever he''s become.'
  waves:
  - pattern: 0
    duration: 9
    intensity: 0.9
  - pattern: 1
    duration: 9
    intensity: 0.9
  - pattern: 2
    duration: 10
    intensity: 1
  puzzles:
  - prompt: 'His thoughts loop: ''If I stop, I fall behind.'' Which memory fragment
      answers him?'
    options:
    - '[DEADLINE: TOMORROW 9:00]'
    - '[A LUNCH BREAK IN THE SUN, 2009]'
    - '[REPLY ALL]'
    correctIndex: 1
    correctLine: The paper wall shivers. Somewhere inside, a man remembers sunlight
      on a sandwich.
    wrongLine: The fragment bounces off. He files it under 'later'.
  - prompt: 'The wall whispers: ''Nobody would notice if I disappeared.'' Choose
      a fragment.'
    options:
    - '[STATISTICALLY TRUE]'
    - '[THE BARISTA WHO KNOWS HIS ORDER]'
    - '[OUT OF OFFICE: FOREVER]'
    correctIndex: 1
    correctLine: '''...She always draws a little cloud on my cup.'' A layer of paper
      peels away.'
    wrongLine: The thought hardens into another sheet of paper.
  - prompt: 'Last firewall: ''Who am I, if I''m not busy?'''
    options:
    - '[PRODUCTIVITY: 87%]'
    - '[UNKNOWN]'
    - '[SOMEONE WHO USED TO DRAW ON NAPKINS]'
    correctIndex: 2
    correctLine: He laughs, a small rusty sound. 'I did, didn't I? Little rockets.
      Little dogs.'
    wrongLine: '''Unknown'' echoes through the wall. It sounds too much like the
      truth he''s afraid of.'
  resolutionLines:
  - ...Oh. It's lunchtime. When did it get so late?
  - I think I'll sit down for a minute. Just a minute.
  - '* The paperwork dissolves into warm pixels. The street ahead is open.'
  portraitTarget: {fileID: 586977475}
  portraitDistance: 2.4
  betweenRoundLines:
  - ...A sandwich. In the sun. I forgot food could be warm.
  - She draws clouds on my cup. Every day. I never said thank you.
  tauntLines:
  - Deadline! Deadline!
  - Per my last email...
  - Can't stop. Won't stop. Shouldn't stop.
  - Circle back! Circle BACK!
  - Is it Friday yet? It's never Friday.
  - Let's take this offline. Forever.
  musicOverride: {fileID: 0}
  requiredFlag: met_kira
  lockedLines:
  - '* A wall of paperwork, humming with dread. Clocks tick inside it, all at different
    speeds.'
  - '* That courier on the skates seemed to know what this is. I should talk to her
    first.'
  flagOnResolved: hack1_done
  hideOnResolved:
  - {fileID: 1186815195}
  showOnResolved:
  - {fileID: 188677517}
  dissolveColor: {r: 1, g: 0.75, b: 0.45, a: 1}
  promptAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  onResolved:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
